schway-screen 1
screen grok-plan-error
title Grok plan restriction
description A plan restriction retains the saved login and offers another connection.
variant light-50
size 50x30
cursor 6 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

 ▌ ! Error
 ▌ Your Grok plan doesn't include API access.
 ▌ Use an xAI API key instead · Alt+L




















